WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:04.737
Toad finished all the letters by noon.

2
00:00:04.738 --> 00:00:08.660
"I wonder who can deliver these?" he thought.

3
00:00:08.661 --> 00:00:13.263
Just then a young ferret appeared at the door.

4
00:00:13.264 --> 00:00:16.986
Toad remembered him from the night before.

5
00:00:16.987 --> 00:00:20.575
"Mr. Toad," said the ferret shyly.

6
00:00:20.576 --> 00:00:24.189
"I feel bad about last night.

7
00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:28.392
Is there anything I can do for you?"

8
00:00:28.393 --> 00:00:31.952
"Why, yes," said Toad.

9
00:00:31.953 --> 00:00:34.563
"Deliver these right away."

10
00:00:34.564 --> 00:00:37.423
Toad handed him the letters.

11
00:00:37.424 --> 00:00:41.189
"Oh, thank you!" cried the ferret.

12
00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:44.488
He ran off to deliver them.

13
00:00:44.489 --> 00:00:49.988
Soon after, Badger, Mole, and Rat returned.

14
00:00:49.989 --> 00:00:54.743
"Hello, friends!" shouted Toad happily.

15
00:00:54.744 --> 00:00:57.945
"Did you order everything for the party?"

16
00:00:57.946 --> 00:01:02.710
Badger, Rat, and Mole looked at each other.

17
00:01:02.711 --> 00:01:07.467
"Well," said Toad, "I'm going for a walk!"

18
00:01:07.468 --> 00:01:11.991
Toad wanted to practice his songs and speeches.

19
00:01:11.992 --> 00:01:15.203
He took a step toward the garden.

20
00:01:15.204 --> 00:01:19.618
Suddenly Rat grabbed Toad's arm.

21
00:01:19.619 --> 00:01:22.403
"Hey, Rat!" cried Toad.

22
00:01:22.404 --> 00:01:24.773
"Let me go!"

23
00:01:24.774 --> 00:01:28.631
Then Badger took Toad's other arm.

24
00:01:28.632 --> 00:01:31.355
"Hey, Badger!" cried Toad.

25
00:01:31.356 --> 00:01:33.454
"What's going on?"

26
00:01:33.455 --> 00:01:37.820
They dragged Toad to a chair.

27
00:01:37.821 --> 00:01:40.881
"Now, look here, Toad," said Rat.

28
00:01:40.882 --> 00:01:43.106
"It's about this party.

29
00:01:43.107 --> 00:01:45.307
What are you planning?

30
00:01:45.308 --> 00:01:48.793
Are you going to show off again?"

31
00:01:48.794 --> 00:01:53.370
"Of course not!" said Toad.

32
00:01:53.371 --> 00:01:56.565
"Well . . ." He paused.

33
00:01:56.566 --> 00:02:00.068
"I might sing a song.

34
00:02:00.069 --> 00:02:04.013
And give a little speech."

